      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "A small note with elegant handwriting, recording the special quirks and aversions of certain guests at \"Inkford Hermitage.\""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-30486838748608db"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "@JustNeedsLove:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Must not be disturbed while watching the news."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-33009c65a70e66f5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pamyuski:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Seems to dislike frogs, foxes, and monkeys."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ae9a4cf6edf75e3f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Tima Soundwave:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hates phone reservations. Prefers face-to-face communication."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8970379592b913ad"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Trevor Klein:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Unless he brings it up first, don't ask about his past. But if he does bring it up, he usually wants to talk."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-46b8f77ff287706c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Soroush:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Philosopher with a penchant for performance art. Most of what he says is not to be taken literally."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4359a6d66350d88a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sharkus:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Whatever you do, don't tell it that it's not actually a shark."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-39081c35b97bc300"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sudscour:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Gets winded easily when speaking. But it's psychological, not actual asthma."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-370b73c9b9dc8d42"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reinhardt:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Whatever it does, just tell it, \"You win again.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2f1a68a70ad2473f"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
